@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5056

### REGISTER USER


POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Muskan",
  "email": "muskan@gmail2.com",
  "password": "Muskan123456"
}

### LOGOUT USER 

POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
### LOGIN USER


POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "muskan@gmail2.com",
  "password": "Muskan123456"
}


### LOGIN WITH WRONG PASSWORD


POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "muskan@gmail.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}


### REGISTER DUPLICATE EMAIL


POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Muskan",
  "email": "muskan@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Get  Users 
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/users



